{"id":"n22667-1-7","stage":2,"title":"여름휴가 · 暑假","scene":"说明与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n22667-1-7-1","ko":"다음 주부터 여름휴가라며? 휴가 때 뭘 할 계획이니?","zh":"听说你下周开始夏季休假？假期有什么计划？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"다음","meaning":"之后","explanation":"다음：之后。","readings":[{"term":"다음","audio":"/audio/aef613c6612d424ab454.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64531","senseId":"4","lemma":"다음","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"다음","audio":"/audio/aef613c6612d424ab454.mp3"}},{"text":"주부터","meaning":"周，星期","explanation":"주：周，星期；부터：表示起点：“从……起”。","readings":[{"term":"주","audio":"/audio/6234d5b178a8b25809d8.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"46811","senseId":"1","lemma":"주","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"주부터","audio":"/audio/2beadcb0ad7b5ddd139b.mp3"}},{"text":"여름휴가라며?","meaning":"暑假，暑期休假","explanation":"여름휴가：暑假，暑期休假；이다：表示“是”的判断形式；라며：引用所听到的话，向对方确认，非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"여름휴가","audio":"/audio/2f326418aa384e842b6e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"22667","senseId":"1","lemma":"여름휴가","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"여름휴가라며","audio":"/audio/eb8eb95e73923ca32ff5.mp3"}},{"text":"휴가","meaning":"休假，度假，放假，假期","explanation":"휴가：休假，度假，放假，假期。","readings":[{"term":"휴가","audio":"/audio/9e9f8123891fae1cf99f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73251","senseId":"1","lemma":"휴가","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"휴가","audio":"/audio/9e9f8123891fae1cf99f.mp3"}},{"text":"때","meaning":"时，时候","explanation":"때：时，时候。","readings":[{"term":"때","audio":"/audio/43bc9c47e0f938b11288.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"74123","senseId":"1","lemma":"때","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"때","audio":"/audio/43bc9c47e0f938b11288.mp3"}},{"text":"뭘","meaning":"什么","explanation":"뭐：什么；ㄹ：을/를 的缩略，标记宾语，如 뭘＝무엇을。","readings":[{"term":"뭐","audio":"/audio/95b5c8cf1b249b7a376b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"84991","senseId":"1","lemma":"뭐","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"뭘","audio":"/audio/441ab920d2baa0d1bea5.mp3"}},{"text":"할","meaning":"做，干","explanation":"하다：做，干；ㄹ：修饰后面的名词，表示预定、意向、推测或可能；具体含义取决于后接表达。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"1","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"할","audio":"/audio/3b4c012b3f82dedb34a0.mp3"}},{"text":"계획이니?","meaning":"计划，筹划","explanation":"계획：计划，筹划；이다：表示“是”的判断形式；니：非敬语疑问句末，用于亲近的人、晚辈或自问。","readings":[{"term":"계획","audio":"/audio/b0fe4ea3ac5ac4022d19.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"23324","senseId":"1","lemma":"계획","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"계획이니","audio":"/audio/29a580029554dc6cbce9.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"aef613c6612d424a","term":"다음","zh":"之后","audio":"/audio/aef613c6612d424ab454.mp3","entryId":"64531","definition":"某事结束后。","pronunciation":["다음"]},{"id":"6234d5b178a8b258","term":"주","zh":"周，星期","audio":"/audio/6234d5b178a8b25809d8.mp3","entryId":"46811","definition":"从周一至周日七天为一周期计算的时间单位。","pronunciation":["주"]},{"id":"2f326418aa384e84","term":"여름휴가","zh":"暑假，暑期休假","audio":"/audio/2f326418aa384e842b6e.mp3","entryId":"22667","definition":"在夏季上学或上班的人在一定期间休息。","pronunciation":["여름휴가"]},{"id":"9e9f8123891fae1c","term":"휴가","zh":"休假，度假，放假，假期","audio":"/audio/9e9f8123891fae1cf99f.mp3","entryId":"73251","definition":"属于工作单位或军队等团体的人在一定期间内从岗位上脱离出来并休息；或指这种时间。","pronunciation":["휴가"]},{"id":"43bc9c47e0f938b1","term":"때","zh":"时，时候","audio":"/audio/43bc9c47e0f938b11288.mp3","entryId":"74123","definition":"指某一瞬间或时间段。","pronunciation":["때"]},{"id":"95b5c8cf1b249b7a","term":"뭐","zh":"什么","audio":"/audio/95b5c8cf1b249b7a376b.mp3","entryId":"84991","definition":"指代不知道的事实或事物。","pronunciation":["뭐ː"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"做，干","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"73277","definition":"进行某种行动、动作或活动。","pronunciation":["하다"]},{"id":"b0fe4ea3ac5ac402","term":"계획","zh":"计划，筹划","audio":"/audio/b0fe4ea3ac5ac4022d19.mp3","entryId":"23324","definition":"仔细考虑并决定将来的事情。","pronunciation":["계ː획","게ː훽"]}],"audio":"/audio/1cd516011fff90553143.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n22667-1-7-2","ko":"일주일동안 가족들과 함께 미국으로 여행을 다녀올까 해.","zh":"想和家人去美国旅行一周。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"일주일동안","meaning":"一周，一星期；期间","explanation":"일주일：一周，一星期；동안：期间。","readings":[{"term":"일주일","audio":"/audio/d7137afeb52708a5fcb9.mp3"},{"term":"동안","audio":"/audio/2aa02e1d6b86b37d7e2b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"30189","senseId":"1","lemma":"일주일","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"},{"entryId":"70749","senseId":"1","lemma":"동안","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"일주일동안","audio":"/audio/01af48610742ddc7ffc5.mp3"}},{"text":"가족들과","meaning":"家庭，家人","explanation":"가족：家庭，家人；들：复数后缀，表示多个对象；과：连接共同参与或比较的对象，常表示“和、与”；结合句中动作理解。","readings":[{"term":"가족","audio":"/audio/7659575fd72a872b8d05.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"44487","senseId":"1","lemma":"가족","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"가족들과","audio":"/audio/a3e89ffa2a04e35bba2e.mp3"}},{"text":"함께","meaning":"一起，共同，与共","explanation":"함께：一起，共同，与共。","readings":[{"term":"함께","audio":"/audio/6d2b6bbf82785e6dce3d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"72465","senseId":"1","lemma":"함께","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"함께","audio":"/audio/6d2b6bbf82785e6dce3d.mp3"}},{"text":"미국으로","meaning":"美国","explanation":"미국：美国；으로：表示方向、方式、手段、材料、身份或原因等关系。","readings":[{"term":"미국으로","audio":"/audio/b95ca4008220200fd1bd.mp3"}],"sources":[],"surfaceReading":{"term":"미국으로","audio":"/audio/b95ca4008220200fd1bd.mp3"}},{"text":"여행을","meaning":"旅行，旅游","explanation":"여행：旅行，旅游；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"여행","audio":"/audio/b5d87b0a7b5d6b82f2a8.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"28026","senseId":"1","lemma":"여행","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"여행을","audio":"/audio/8e4d1a5a7460b5dcfa6a.mp3"